 "text": "8\nA tennis ball with momentum 2.3kgm/s is struck by a tennis racket.\nThe racket causes the direction of motion of the ball to reverse.\nThe racket exerts an average force of 1500N during the impact with the ball. The racket and ball\nare in contact with each other for a time of 0.0024s.\nWhat is the magnitude of the momentum of the ball as it leaves the tennis racket?\nA\n1.3kgm/s\nB\n3.6kgm/s\nC\n5.9kgm/s\nD\n8.6kgm/s",
